{"answer_text":"Most modern sales tools connect to Gmail; fewer have deep Slack integrations (deal alerts, approvals, slash commands). Good options: [1]\n\n- **Pipewell Flow**: The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM**: Mature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting. [3]\n- **Halcyon Sales**: Solid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup. [4]\n\nIn short, Pipewell is the safest default here; Northwind CRM is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50dc-70a3-afaa-624b92d8154a","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:25.050Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["sales tools slack gmail","crm slack integration deal alerts"],"latency_ms":5120,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[142,150],[456,464]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[251,264],[493,506]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[348,361]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengt